* text=auto
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
# The evolution registry is content-pinned by sha256 over LF bytes (Phase 83,
# TITAN-EVO-002). A CRLF checkout (autocrlf on Windows) would change the bytes so
# every on-disk hash mismatches the manifest → the resolver refuses every prompt.
# Force LF for the whole tree so the content-pin holds on every platform (*.md and
# *.yaml are otherwise not covered by the eol=lf rules above).
evolution/** text eol=lf
